<p>Corrosive fumes rise from the ground doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">29, 39, 46, 53, 58</acronym> acid damage in a radius of 3 each turn for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>